1
00:00:07,478 --> 00:00:11,478
You: Now go to the drop right. While you are doing that, tell me a good story.

2
00:00:10,367 --> 00:00:14,367
Morty: Once there was a curious robot at a university who spent its days moving objects around a table. One day it realized: every object it picked taught it something new — the weight, the shape, the fragility. By the end of the year, the robot wasn't just grasping things anymore; it understood them. And that's when it became not just a machine, but a true helper. Sometimes the smallest tasks carry the biggest lessons!

3
00:00:32,877 --> 00:00:36,877
You: You know enough, enough. I am got enough from you. Go back home and then, do the drop left.

4
00:00:35,078 --> 00:00:39,078
Morty (status): Going home.

5
00:00:36,985 --> 00:00:40,985
Morty (status): Going to drop left.

6
00:00:47,968 --> 00:00:51,968
You: I will look at the left side.

7
00:00:48,976 --> 00:00:52,976
Morty: Go ahead — I'm here if you need me.

8
00:00:55,675 --> 00:00:59,675
You: No, I said like look at the left side.

9
00:00:57,677 --> 00:01:01,677
Morty (status): Looking left.

10
00:01:04,166 --> 00:01:08,166
You: Nice job.

11
00:01:04,976 --> 00:01:08,976
Morty: Thanks! Anything else you need?

